{{!
    @template block_oksigeniatembiapo/door

    One door of «Your services», inside its list item: the logo of the product on its light plate, the name (the link:
    the whole door leads in), how many alerts it has (red only when one is urgent), the state with its figures and up
    to two shortcuts, which stay links of their own above the door.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title, url - the name of the service and where the door leads
    * icon - the address of the logo of its product (its pix/icon), or the block's neutral one
    * status - optional: one line with figures
    * hasalerts, alertcount, urgent - how many alerts it has, and whether one is urgent (always given, also as false)
    * hasactions, actions - optional: up to two shortcuts, each with label and url

    Example context (json):
    {
        "key": "local_example", "id": "tembiapo-local_example", "title": "Library", "url": "#",
        "status": "1,284 books · 37 on loan",
        "icon": "https://moodle.example/blocks/oksigeniatembiapo/pix/generic.svg",
        "alertcount": 2, "hasalerts": true, "urgent": false, "hasactions": true,
        "actions": [{"label": "Lend", "url": "#"}, {"label": "Return", "url": "#"}]
    }
}}
<div class="tbp-door-card">
    <span class="tbp-plate" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{icon}}" alt="" width="32" height="32"></span>
    {{#hasalerts}}<span class="tbp-count" aria-hidden="true">{{alertcount}}</span>{{/hasalerts}}
    <a class="tbp-door-link" href="{{url}}"><span class="tbp-door-title">{{title}}</span>{{#hasalerts}}<span class="tbp-sr">, {{#str}}count, block_oksigeniatembiapo, {{alertcount}}{{/str}}</span>{{/hasalerts}}<svg class="tbp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 8h9.5M8.5 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a>
    {{#status}}<p class="tbp-door-status">{{status}}</p>{{/status}}
    {{#hasactions}}<p class="tbp-door-actions">{{#actions}}<a class="tbp-door-action" href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{/actions}}</p>{{/hasactions}}
</div>
